      "body": "## Purpose\n\nWith `data_parallel_size > 1` and expert parallel enabled, only some DP ranks may hold tokens on a given engine step while others schedule zero tokens. Idle ranks must still run a dummy forward so per-layer EP collectives stay in lockstep; otherwise the busy rank deadlocks in all2all.\n\nToday `execute_model` only runs that dummy when `distributed_executor_backend == \"external_launcher\"`. Multiproc / MoRIIO WideEP disagg uses a different backend, so zero-token ranks skip the dummy and hang.\n\nHeadless / idle ranks may only enter via `Worker.execute_dummy_batch`. That path must also always `_dummy_run(1)` for `dp_size > 1`. Do **not** skip via a sticky latch set by `execute_model`: under dp_lockstep the latch can remain `True` across later engine steps when `execute_dummy_batch` was not paired with the call that set it. Skipping a needed dummy desyncs EP ranks (GLM-5.2 tip WideEP mid-gsm8k hang). Same-step double dummy is safe; a skipped dummy is not.\n\n## Changes\n\n* `vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py` (`execute_model`):\n  * On zero-token steps, run `_dummy_run(1)` whenever `data_parallel_size > 1` (not only `external_launcher`).\n* `vllm/v1/worker/gpu_worker.py` (`execute_dummy_batch`):\n  * When `data_parallel_size > 1`, always `_dummy_run(1)` (no sticky early-return).\n\n## Test Plan\n\nMoRIIO **2P2D wide-EP** (DP16) disaggregated serving, image `vllm/vllm-openai-rocm:nightly`. Front-door: `ROUTER_TYPE=proxy` and `vllm-router`.\n\n### GLM-5.2-FP8 — 2P2D wide-EP DP16\n\n```bash\nexport VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1\nexport VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_MLA=1\nexport VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_MOE=1\nexport VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_RMSNORM=1\nexport VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_FUSION_SHARED_EXPERTS=0\n# HT/LL path (unset ALL2ALL_BACKEND); P eager / D PIECEWISE\n\n# PREFILL — master (node0, DP ranks 0–7)\nvllm serve /data/models2/GLM-5.2-FP8 \\\n    --host $PREFILL_IP --port 20005 -tp 1 \\\n    --data-parallel-size 16 \\\n    --data-parallel-size-local 8 \\\n    --data-parallel-address $PREFILL_IP \\\n    --data-parallel-rpc-port 13345 \\\n    --enable-expert-parallel \\\n    --trust-remote-code \\\n    --kv-cache-dtype fp8 \\\n    --gpu-memory-utilization 0.85 \\\n    --enforce-eager \\\n    --kv-transfer-config '{\"kv_connector\":\"MoRIIOConnector\",\"kv_role\":\"kv_producer\",\n      \"kv_connector_extra_config\":{\"proxy_ip\":\"'$PREFILL_IP'\",\"proxy_port\":\"10001\",\n      \"proxy_ping_port\":\"36367\",\"http_port\":\"20005\",\"handshake_port\":\"6301\",\"notify_port\":\"61005\"}}'\n\n# PREFILL — child (node1, headless, DP ranks 8–15)\nvllm serve /data/models2/GLM-5.2-FP8 \\\n    -tp 1 \\\n    --data-parallel-size 16 \\\n    --data-parallel-size-local 8 \\\n    --data-parallel-address $PREFILL_IP \\\n    --data-parallel-rpc-port 13345 \\\n    --data-parallel-start-rank 8 \\\n    --headless \\\n    --enable-expert-parallel \\\n    --trust-remote-code \\\n    --kv-cache-dtype fp8 \\\n    --gpu-memory-utilization 0.85 \\\n    --enforce-eager\n\n# DECODE — master (node2) / child (node3): same DP16 layout, kv_consumer,\n# PIECEWISE cudagraph (not enforce-eager), same MoRIIO proxy ports.\n```\n\n### GSM8K evaluation\n\n```bash\nlm_eval --model local-completions \\\n    --tasks gsm8k \\\n    --model_args \"model=/data/models2/GLM-5.2-FP8,base_url=http://127.0.0.1:10001/v1/completions,num_concurrent=64,max_retries=3,tokenized_requests=False,trust_remote_code=True,timeout=7200\" \\\n    --limit 1319\n```\n\n## Test Result\n\nGLM-5.2-FP8, MoRIIO 2P2D wide-EP DP16 (proxy), GSM8K flexible-extract, `num_concurrent=64`, limit 1319.\n\n| Variant | Health | GSM8K exact_match |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Sticky skip (latch honors True) | Hang mid-wave (C_MIDWAVE) | — |\n| This fix (`num_concurrent=64`) | Pass | **0.9348** (11305) |\n\n",
      "changedFiles": 2,
